# Deny by default. Only deterministic build inputs are admitted below.
**
!Dockerfile
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.build.json
!src/
!src/**
!tools/
!tools/release/
!tools/release/prune-runtime.mjs

# Never admit credentials, environment overrides, certificates, or token material.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.cer
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*token*
**/*secret*
**/*credential*

# Local workflow, agent, provenance, review, and repository metadata stay outside the context.
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.planning
**/.planning/**
**/.agents
**/.agents/**
**/.claude
**/.claude/**
**/.codex
**/.codex/**
**/.cursor
**/.cursor/**
**/.gemini
**/.gemini/**
**/.gsd
**/.gsd/**
**/.opencode
**/.opencode/**
**/AGENTS.md
**/CLAUDE.md
**/GEMINI.md
**/*REVIEW*.md
**/*PROOF*.md

# Dependencies, generated output, tests, fixtures, target residue, and transient files are rebuilt or excluded.
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/dist
**/dist/**
**/build
**/build/**
**/coverage
**/coverage/**
**/.pnpm-store
**/.pnpm-store/**
**/tests
**/tests/**
**/fixtures
**/fixtures/**
**/tmp
**/tmp/**
**/temp
**/temp/**
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.swp
**/.DS_Store
